msgctxt "ui.consent.title"
msgid "Before you start: analytics"
msgstr "Prije nego počnete: analitika"

msgctxt "ui.consent.body"
msgid "We would like to count visits with Google Analytics, which sets cookies in your browser and sends Google the page you are on. It is not needed to check a robots.txt, so it is your choice, and the check works exactly the same either way."
msgstr "Željeli bismo brojati posjete uz Google Analytics, koji postavlja kolačiće u vaš pregljednik i Googleu šalje stranicu na kojoj ste. Za provjeru robots.txt nije potreban, pa je izbor vaš, a provjera radi potpuno isto u oba slučaja."

msgctxt "ui.consent.never"
msgid "The address you check is never sent to Google, whichever you choose."
msgstr "Adresa koju provjeravate nikada se ne šalje Googleu, što god odaberete."

